  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated water resources management action plan phase 2 APPUI AU PAGIRE 2) BF - TA to PAGIRE 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsplan f&#xf6;r integrerade vatten f&#xf6;rvaltning, fas 2.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2015, integrated water resource management (IWRM) is implemented  in favor of socio-economic development of Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project objective is to apply IWRM in all the five river basins of    Burkina Faso by 2015. This will be done through the establishment of  operational river basin agencies, the developement and implementation of water resources (master) management plans, the developement of a   water information system etc.A water fee will be also applyed to all  the water users and polluters.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Project objective is to apply IWRM in all the five river basins of    Burkina Faso by 2015. This will be done through the establishment of  operational river basin agencies, the developement and implementation of water resources (master) management plans, the developement of a   water information system etc.A water fee will be also applyed to all  the water users and polluters.</narrative>
  </description>
